# ============================================================
# 行尾统一规范 (2026-09-04, 文档归档战役)
# 存储层统一 LF; 工作区文本统一 CRLF (Windows 生态)
# ============================================================
* text=auto
*.md text eol=crlf
*.java text eol=crlf
*.py text eol=crlf
*.csv text eol=crlf
*.json text eol=crlf
*.txt text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.class binary
*.jar binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.wav binary
*.ogg binary
*.mp3 binary
*.jfr binary
*.zip binary
*.replay binary
*.dat binary

# 批处理: 中文 Windows 的 cmd 按 OEM 代码页(GBK)解析, 而 .bat 内含中文路径与注释
# → 以 GBK 落盘且不做行尾归一, 否则 UTF-8/换行转换会让 cmd 解析错位 (2026-09-24 实测)
*.bat -text
